<title>DUBAI: Kuwait drops August propane, butane unchanged-KPC.</title>
<headline>Kuwait drops August propane, butane unchanged-KPC.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Corp (KPC) has set its August price for propane at $172 a tonne from $175 a tonne for July, KPC said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It set the price of butane at $192 a tonne unchanged from July.</p>
</text>
